，设计者考虑的非常周到，还有那些车灯边框做了包胶大家也可以说说看。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic20kq6pzTBHGwcMtUbzXwsia5ia0q6lSKafnBufEV1cjaiaU80PiacuOf9A/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"全周边缘包胶"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johiczABhfUgnHbD6F0rwhrkO8Zicu53YPXVRJjsFiaySic551EFfcHooSAXkA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"很明显，该灯采用的是热板溶着工艺，溢出控制较好，比较均匀。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicxafoCFKXxgKlZSY6WDse1mb3QPtqoZ5EXN0BdFibNS5mHd7FQGdcm3g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"切掉灯罩正面上面三个透镜是STOP下面两个透镜是TURN红色灯带是TAIL"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johictqmJMdDIy8hQSNbHk2tHBuIvA6YePibyqCOECA8icbib6NW31g6tCg9Tg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"背面，红色灯罩、半透明白灯罩、LED基板支架三个部分采用热铆+螺丝固定"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic4zUeIiakOnO4St50ek36h1l5AuIYMKd445W42NmIIOkrYEdRsyFrq4g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"热铆点很扎实"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicicdvLrvjZZ1lSPPibsc4lcuBqT0YBSOicC1Hx5wewKojq3HtpPN6picKoA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"继续拆，TURN部分有八颗灯珠"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicVI0lLxNicR7qZfIQUXz79BDokUIPKqPNzU5n0V5ZXy6MAmS6z95aPoA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"TURN 透镜"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicdalVicz2kRKgRIjq18fT3gQTibFyCd0Hn48ePse6x22icblia86QfOULpQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"STOP部分 12颗灯珠"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicJqYJnXaHibp2h9IbX1CTwRHsI9O7tKmJqmmWFLDwRGkSnugtNmm2S5g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"STOP 透镜"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic9pLeiaNxXxOCSw3Aw9wYUnF8NAmgcUcZ0QMUlSFlGJvfCdIX9QlmRFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"细节，透镜与灯珠对应部分，没有明显成型缺陷"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicZqq5oeI90SrFxBiaREOibpsTkQ6yB8rKuxfISKodJcP8vtmtE35tEsPw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"背面细节"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicAYCba2SmcaYp6mdibWHOaHq4iaM0ib6SdQD3xbaibtwIKXDMxF3ThmxfaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"灯框是红黑双色一体成型"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic5Xq6EyAQEKfWwr5FZ3iaeOdMV8HTT21nUtCOxYjz0Sj9wCgpUq5GicfA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic4scRGcXZezu540AicB3Dw57PCAicwKKYqImpWKpkq8sM2fJfX3mULxHw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"三个相同为STOP的透镜两个相同为TURN的透镜"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicARzZp6fKaEnA5IUriagOmS16UciaEk61TrD9Mzo4jeB8pbIMcicrQXbDA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johichJYzeLuNZwiccrw78me0YUelksfmK0KS8SaU16kysvJrJn6lyicJMqzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"这个灯组光照下晶莹剔透很是漂亮"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicbcaBKic9ZNQ7NsjZUDnR0884sTDmLib7ib7iaIBM7CDV9giadyclym7LCbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg"},{"t":"text","v":"不得不说这个灯框做工非常棒(下图)，整体红黑双色成型，然后还要铝蒸着，内部全周菱形花纹，边缘磨砂处理，可视之处未见任何瑕疵，细节几乎完美。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicYMgIDv8SvrjB0HpzRnv8icW8XV0gA68uov8S8spDURA5AHxPtoa2oibQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"TAIL部分灯珠"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicUtfyhlChkQKRe288cwvqO1jHUMD6In4eicte8OQDwAWfcE87nEojjLg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"TAIL灯组 左右两侧都是软基板连接的LED灯带，与支架固定采用热铆的工艺热铆点大小均一，形状饱满"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicxVWS97x7feA1URhPZJFib8VicZ0A9ibrr7Eib3q2nlBxssGca5EDicvJNNg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"整灯控制板"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicmUCk8ue7PkxBVteeBdzzy0TDFM9bgF4rwzHcZaegNDyP1As8gnSuFA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"细节-1"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicrIFExiavaVvCjfJH8vmXBKFhMxy1ms96uPvYLibnUdf4ndibpo9NhicQUA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg"},{"t":"text","v":"细节-2"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johiccf9weR5hbW2cwGyWlYZvQysPgJaFQUWF1YY3JYGo0Jgaic0618yujqw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg"},{"t":"text","v":"灯壳"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic0qslb2cBE7kh3v8XDvLc1dUwibVEXh7IkvbpYrh5YVklG6xTyaNoE4g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"主线束"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicicfem5L3v6SbAaXadUNfrjajoR0ccbms7fOoic5tGJPbvaT2lnUR1FBQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg"},{"t":"text","v":"线束插头"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicmyKD4YdglUyKeA6ibTAvXZkD0TibjXBPpG1Y805ScQcEiasSbHzhZD3bw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic8UmpicrxQpDbeg6SpoUqaXzdia79ibLUTwu9scqVWkALVvMgxNeUsykFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"至此，整灯拆解完毕！来个全家福。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johiczj1HpADHx3mONWqGQc7XG0hEGVG9f0jBPAHtMLfHJGhxCaWd31q9Ow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"不得不说，就笔者个人而言，这款灯无论是设计、造型，还是的做工均属上乘，工艺细节处理非常到位，让人眼前一亮！最后，这款灯来自曼德光电。"}],"coverImg":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaPXCoSb1ktQtvj4qicHKEj9QKNXsXyKLxXUWSChXIc1cl4POibRfh4SaaW0YPrl6Bd3MQVem8bZ21Mg/640?wx_fmt=other&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&tp=webp"}